  - Body: 13px / 400 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body Strong: 13px / 600 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body Small: 12px / 400 / 1.45 / 0
  - Caption: 11px / 600 / 1.4 / 0.02em UPPERCASE
  - Code: 13px / 400 / 1.5 'Cascadia Code', monospace

### ⑤ 스페이싱
- **Base unit**: 4px (Fluent 2)
- **토큰**:
  ```css
  --space-xs:  4px;
  --space-sm:  8px;
  --space-md: 12px;
  --space-lg: 16px;
  --space-xl: 20px;
  --space-2xl: 28px;
  --space-3xl: 40px;
  ```
- **Container**: max-width 1440px (포털), 좌우 패딩 16px

### ⑥ Border Radius
```css
--radius-none: 0;       /* 카드, 테이블 */
--radius-sm: 2px;       /* Fluent 2 Small */
--radius-md: 4px;       /* 버튼 */
--radius-lg: 8px;
--radius-full: 9999px;
```

### ⑦ Shadow / Elevation (Fluent 2 Depth)
```css
--shadow-none: none;
--shadow-2: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.36), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
--shadow-4: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.40), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
--shadow-8: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.46), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
--shadow-16: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.50), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
--shadow-28: 0 14px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.60);
```

### ⑧ Iconography
- **스타일**: Fluent UI Icons (Regular + Filled)
- **Stroke 굵기**: 1.5px equivalent
- **모서리 처리**: Square 베이스
- **추천 라이브러리**: Fluent UI Icons / Azure Service Icons

